OL,3,GNEWSAFootpath reopens after scaffolding
OL,4,Ais removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FScaffolding that blocked a footpath for
OL,7,Feight years has finally been removed.
OL,9,FThe temporary structure supported the
OL,10,Fremains of a former factory in High
OL,11,FStreet, Aylesbury, but stretched across
OL,12,Fa narrow pavement, forcing pedestrians
OL,13,Finto the road to reach a row of shops.
OL,15,FBuckinghamshire Council said it had
OL,16,Fworked with the building's owners to
OL,17,Fclear the scaffolding and make the path
OL,18,Fsafe for pedestrians.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
